sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Staff MANAGE_BLOG
    participant UI as Staff Blog Editor
    participant Ctrl as StaffBlogController
    participant R2 as CloudflareR2StorageService
    participant Svc as BlogPostService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16

    Note over Staff,DB: S-08: Tai anh len Cloudflare R2, tao nhap, sinh slug tieng Viet, nop duyet va thu hoi (BR-ADM-08)

    Staff->>UI: Chon anh bia <= 5 MB (JPG/PNG/WEBP)
    UI->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/staff/blogs/upload-media (multipart/form-data)
    Ctrl->>Ctrl: Kiem tra kich thuoc <= 5MB & duoi tep hop le (else MSG-NTF-03 / MSG-CLS-01)
    Ctrl->>R2: UploadRecyclerDocumentAsync(stream, fileName, contentType, "blog-media")
    R2-->>Ctrl: Uploaded fileUrl (CDN R2)
    Ctrl-->>UI: 200 OK BlogMediaUploadResponseDto

    Staff->>UI: Nhap tieu de (10-150 ky tu), noi dung, tags (<=5) va bam Luu nhap / Nop duyet
    UI->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/staff/blogs (SaveBlogPostRequest)
    Ctrl->>Svc: CreateAsync(staffId, request)
    Svc->>Svc: Normalize(request) + Slugify(Title) (khu dau tieng Viet, bo ky tu dac biet)
    Svc->>DB: UniqueSlugAsync(baseSlug) -> neu trung them -2, -3... + SaveWithSlugRetryAsync
    alt SubmitForApproval == false
        Svc-->>Ctrl: 201 Created BlogPostDto (Status = Draft, CanEdit = true)
    else SubmitForApproval == true
        Svc->>Svc: EnsureSubmittable (bat buoc co CoverImageUrl + Content, else MSG-AUTH-02)
        Svc->>DB: BeginTransaction -> UPDATE Status = PendingApproval, SubmittedAt = NOW()
        Svc->>DB: NotifyAdminsAsync ("Co bai viet cho duyet")
        Svc->>DB: Commit Transaction
        Ctrl-->>UI: 201 Created MSG-ADM-06 (Status = Pending_Approval, CanRecall = true)
    end

    opt Staff thu hoi bai dang cho duyet de sua tiep
        Staff->>UI: Nhan Thu hoi ve ban nhap
        UI->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/staff/blogs/{id}/recall
        Ctrl->>Svc: RecallAsync(staffId, postId)
        Svc->>DB: UPDATE blog_posts SET status = Draft, submitted_at = NULL WHERE status = PendingApproval
        Svc->>DB: NotifyAdminsAsync ("Bai viet da duoc thu hoi")
        Ctrl-->>UI: 200 OK BlogPostDto (CanEdit = true)
    end
